| !Help for Fireworkz
|
| HTML help is preferred if a browser is available, with fallback to Text
|
| For HTML help, use:
| a) UserGuide that has been manually integrated into Fireworkz with MergeGuide
| b) UserGuide from the Fireworkz-Manuals package, if installed
| c) basic help from Fireworkz package
|
| Take care with possibly-unset paths
|
If "<Fireworkz$Dir>"="" Then <Obey$Dir>.!Boot
|
If "<Fireworkz$Path>"="" Then Set Fireworkz$Path <Fireworkz$Dir>.Resources.UK.,<Fireworkz$Dir>.Resources.Neutral.
|
If "<Alias$@RunType_FAF>"="" Then Filer_Run Fireworkz:RISC_OS.Help.Text
If "<Alias$@RunType_FAF>"="" Then Obey
|
Set FireworkzManuals$Path Fireworkz:RISC_OS.,<Boot$Dir>.^.Manuals.Fireworkz.UK.
|
| Prefer the UserGuide as help, falling back to basic help
Set Fireworkz$Help FireworkzManuals:UserGuide.index/htm
IfThere <Fireworkz$Help> Then Else Set Fireworkz$Help Fireworkz:RISC_OS.Help.HTML.index/html
|
IfThere <Fireworkz$Help> Then Filer_Run <Fireworkz$Help> Else Error HTML Help not found
